      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DUSTIN (4) recorded an impressive win after leading them home making it three on end at this track over 515m (29.19). Hard to go past. NARINGAL LAD (2) was a big winner two back scoring by 1.4 lengths then got further back last time but came home hard into second and beaten one length at this track (29.68). Goes very well from this draw with two wins and two minor placings from four starts. Hard to beat again. MONUMENT (1) turned in a fair run last time from the squeeze finishing fifth by 3 lengths (30.40). Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. WEBLEC MEMPHIS (3) is a last-start placegetter in a competitive race - should be thereabouts.",
